lt as a grapple move.</span></span><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/8pOlMayTH9COKif4EqBUMObO0vDg23n1BYPhBJoTjTHer7kSiviJOsCReFPLCh2djbim-oWPkbcGES-s220GIzFnW2QL4LgPXcQ6svYYXkkTKHJ_rDs6hBRgBcyWaMHWUDkGJNR6\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Adalku</i><br /> Dexterity +2, Stamina +1<br /> Aquatic<br /> Ink<br /> Tentacles/Beak (+0L)<br /> Boneless<br /> Size -1<br /> Perception +4</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Entangled:</b> Once per round, the weresquid may spend 1 Essence to make a grapple move as a reflexive action against someone either the weresquid is already grappling, or who is within tentacle's length distance.</span></span><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/9ArMPddLePP3LibsTBJjU2HoxKcVhi8dC5NKlEacjhE7E2bopIIpYWjGp8rUMHrjA6lWyJX6vGP_C5wnoFxwXkJB4Lm90MT3kOweM3X8O48URVa8NOpVwT_znlBUpiYIJZZQ4iLU\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1423,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","user":"espritdecalmar","date":". 01-26-2016, 05:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T14:57:29-08:00","id":817191,"title":"","content":"I skimmed around, can't find that consume brain maneuver. Where is it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T15:03:27-08:00","id":817194,"title":"","content":"&quot;. . . a weresquid must be in either <i>fa'ra</i> or <i>kirul</i> to consume a person's brain (straight from the head anyway). First, he must establish a grapple. Then he must perform a special new grapple move called Consume Brain. In <i>fa'ra</i>, the weresquid must use this move three times in a row to fully extract the brain, while as the monstrous <i>kirul</i>, he needs only a single turn of insertion. When performing the Consume Brain move, the weresquid wraps his buccal tentacles around the victim's head and digs into the back of the skull. Every turn that the weresquid uses the Consume Brain move, he inflicts his net successes in lethal damage as he opens up his victim's head. This does mean that certain beings with powerful enough regeneration can stall or even completely deter a <i>Kun-shulor</i>'s efforts. A human that somehow survives a brain-eating attempt will require immediate hospitalization and intensive care, followed by innumerate psychotherapy sessions.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}